thema by default. But if your &quot;Exigent&quot; is running round with a bunch of outlaws and rebels trying to topple the Realm then you're still an Anathema.<br /> <br /> But a decent Guile can go a long way if you don't flare.</div> </div> </div> </div> The player is currently alone and pretending to be a mortal in a Satrapy. She is considering her options since this isn't sustainable in the long run.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23788-braininthejar","name":"Braininthejar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T14:55:27-07:00","id":1409015,"title":"","content":"Perfect Mirror disguises even your anima. If you want to look like a certain type of exalt you can without much difficulty, but you can't replicate the powers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}